# BugOS FCM fix - chay o class late_start, KHONG dung `disabled`.
#
# VI SAO BO `disabled` + `on property:sys.boot_completed=1`:
#   Do tren annibale (A17/OS4.0.6, build 21/11) ca 3 service cua BugOS deu
#   khong chay du file rc da duoc init nap (init.svc.bugos_sukisu_manager =
#   stopped, 2 cai kia rong). Kiem tra cheo tren chinh ROM do:
#     dmesgd, boottrace, aisealhostservice - service CUA ROM, cung dung
#     `on property:sys.boot_completed=1` - cung KHONG chay (init.svc rong).
#   Trong khi do cac service late_start KHONG co disabled thi chay binh thuong:
#     gatekeeperd, traced -> running
#   => Trigger `on property:sys.boot_completed=1` khong con hieu luc tren ROM
#      nay (boot_completed duoc set o stage khac, sau khi init da parse xong
#      rc va khong con dispatch trigger cho property do nua).
#
# Cach lam dung: bo `disabled` de init tu start o class late_start, giong
# gatekeeperd. Script TU CHO sys.boot_completed (vong while o dau fcm-fix.sh),
# nen khong can trigger nua - va do la ly do script da co san vong cho.
#
# Neu service khong chay, kiem tra:
#   dmesg | grep -E "avc.*bugos|bugos-fcm"
service bugos-fcm /system/bin/sh /system/bin/bugos-fcm.sh
    class late_start
    user root
    group root system
    oneshot
    seclabel u:r:shell:s0
